  "description": "*The best guys are where you least expect them.* \n\nOne lonely night, Julia finds an odd boy named William in her wardrobe. They quickly become friends, and soon he begins appearing whenever she needs someone to talk to. As the two grow closer, Julia falls for this mysterious boy, igniting a magical love story that transcends time and space.\n\n(Source: Manta) \n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
